{"author":{"id":"038d65070aa747b6bc9d50939fa697ec871a40ed259db54429b255bbef2581d6"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792401868,"nonce":"IE+0N0eMeamVyzPeNctTL6p1qfo=","title":"Git built-in extension (libgit2 over RayScript FFI)","message":"Part of the built-in extensions plan (umbrella issue). Needs: extension manager, rayscript native FFI, editor services listed in the umbrella. Milestones M2 to M5 there.\n\nFolder `extensions/git/`: `git.rayext`, `ext/` (repository model, status, SCM view, diff view, commands), `natives/libgit2` built by `scripts/build-libgit2.sh` (cmake, pinned release and checksum, shared library, `USE_SSH=exec`, bundled zlib and regex), staged and packaged like the other native libraries.\n\nActivation: `workspaceContains:.git` (and the repository above the project root), `onCommand:git.*`.\n\nCommands (ids `git.\u003cname\u003e`): refresh, stage, unstage, stageAll, discard, commit, commitAmend, checkout, createBranch, deleteBranch, stash, stashPop, fetch, pull, push, openChanges, openFile, history, blame, describe.\n\nViews: `scm` in the sidebar (groups: Merge conflicts, Staged, Changes, Untracked; count badges; row actions through menus `scm/resource/context`; commit message input and button), `diff` as an editor tab. Menus: `explorer/context`, `editor/title`, `scm/title`, `status`.\n\nSettings (extension section): `git.enabled`, `git.autorefresh`, `git.confirmDiscard`, `git.decorations`, `git.diffMode` (unified, split), `git.signoff`, `git.runHooks`.\n\nData and refresh: status through `git_status_foreach` on the blocking lane, options from `git_status_options_init`; results as arrays of `{path, index, workdir, renamedFrom}`; Explorer badges sent in batches; gutter changes from `git_diff_blob_to_buffer` of the buffer against the index or HEAD blob, recomputed on `file.changed` (debounced) and `active.changed`.\n\nHooks and the CLI: libgit2 does not run hooks, sign with gpg or do interactive rebase. Commit runs `pre-commit`, `commit-msg` and `post-commit` through `process.spawn` when `git.runHooks`; rebase, cherry-pick UI and signing call the `git` CLI.\n\nCredentials: ssh through ssh-agent (libgit2 with `USE_SSH=exec` runs `ssh`), https through `git credential fill`; a prompt through `rayde.window.prompt` when the helper has nothing.\n\n`git.describe`: `{repository, branch, upstream, ahead, behind, counts: {staged, changes, untracked, conflicts}, lastError}`.\n\nExit criteria per milestone, tests, a scripted repository fixture, the snapshot scenario `git`, and the `docs/git.md` chapter with screenshots are in the umbrella plan. A benchmark of status on a 10k-file repository gates M2.","files":null}]}